h に対応しようと思うとあったほうがいいのかもしれない。","ts":"1637815806.113200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8u/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d4bc87e-e13d-4acb-a0a9-d665cd629b76","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"truncate は nowrap + scrolloff=0 でお茶を濁している。。。","ts":"1637815763.112700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"npc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b03a668-774e-4211-9e90-22ef3716a54d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ウィンドウ幅いっぱいに収まらない場合は結局 truncate は必要そう","ts":"1637815685.112000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aOtuq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1ddcf26-88c6-4bbb-80a6-2a6efd4dca09","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"_それとは別に pum が広すぎると使いにくいので別途 truncate はほしいかもですね_","ts":"1637815574.111300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zeu=o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3be9866-befa-473e-bb25-6c9bc703dca2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"native pum って「基本は補完 offset 位置を左端に合わせて表示する」というロジックだけど、それだと右側が見切れる。という場合、「補完 offset 位置 - 見切れる幅」の位置に表示していた記憶があります。","ts":"1637815525.110700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"faZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3dd8a50f-720c-4b80-a5e4-095d5fbdaf54","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それだと行末の方の情報が見えなくなっちゃうので… pum.vim が情報をバッファにセットする際に自前で truncate しないといけない気がしてますね","ts":"1637815385.108400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XGE="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffe6549a-6e2c-483a-af34-5f8023ea0c43","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"それはそうですね\npum内のバッファに対して折り返さないオプションをセットするとかかな（Vimとしてはあった気がするけど思い出せない）","ts":"1637815310.107100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XcKI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b407930-f28a-41f1-9dec-d36a5ce68e10","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"pum.vim 固有の問題にも思えるので ddc で解決するのもなんか違う気がしますね","ts":"1637815247.106100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I9fFp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0d6f5bc-e564-414f-8211-1fa5b8f566f5","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あーなるほど、もっと動的に計算できるアプローチが必要か","ts":"1637815156.105500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NiT5E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f516d38-921e-43b0-b585-bc8e4bc76ca8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"pum ウィンドウの幅がいくつになるかは場合によって変わるので、それ以下なのに省略しちゃうのもなんかもったいない気がしますね","ts":"1637815087.104800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hVOG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb4ae04e-10c8-4abe-8078-4ccf5fb303c7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"こういうのを使うとかですかね\n\u003chttps://github.com/matsui54/ddc-converter_truncate\u003e","ts":"1637815002.104000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"matsui54/ddc-converter_truncate","id":1,"title":"matsui54/ddc-converter_truncate","text":"Converter for ddc.vim which truncates completion items","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"2","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"TypeScript","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U01G63H9VN3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nB=O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33e653aa-bb8f-41b5-9f8b-81d49fe3b508","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"pum.vim でバッファ内に折り返しが発生しちゃうことがあるのは仕方ないんですかねー\n拾った候補の中に 1 つでも長いのがあると全候補が折り返されちゃう","ts":"1637814937.103700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RLFXb"}]}]
